# `abs` of integers (`long`), reals and timespans.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where orderId == 'o-0001'
| project a = abs(-5), b = abs(toint(-3)), c = abs(-2.5), d = abs(-90m)
---- expected
a    | b    | c    | d
long | long | real | timespan
-----+------+------+---------
   5 |    3 |  2.5 | 01:30:00
